            "open_new_window_image": false,
            "sub_title": "",
            "title": "Values",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>Our story unfolds over eighteen decades – inspired by the values of trust, purity, and transparency. Generations of the Gadgil family have employed their experience and expertise to abide by being a global hallmark of traditional designs while bringing a fresh twist to contemporary designs. A journey adorned with the values of goodness, creativity, and evolution!</p>",
