            "open_new_window_image": false,
            "sub_title": "",
            "title": "Vision",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>Building from our rich heritage and design expertise, we commit to being a preferred, global jewellery company delighting our customers and stakeholders.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "open_new_window": false,
            "show_button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "column_7YjQX7": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/our-story-values-3_1.webp",
            "image_link": "",
            "open_new_window_image": false,
            "sub_title": "",
            "title": "Mission",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_size": 100,
            "text": "<p>Over the years, PNG Jewellers has been incredibly successful in enduring the beauty of traditions with a comprehensive product range of classic and contemporary jewellery collections across the globe. With a user-friendly shopping experience, we aim to fulfill our customers' shopping desires with the best services offline and make online shopping much more convenient and delightful from the comfort of a couch.</p>",
